                  "authorCandidatePackage": "curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-06/chemie-b008-twenty-six-native-source-preparation-author-v11",
                  "routineCandidateKey": "upper-model-use-criticism",
                  "sourceBindingStatus": "prospective_partial_components_only_no_national_clearance"
                }
              },
              "title": "Chemische Modelle theoriegestützt nutzen und kritisch vergleichen",
              "titleEn": "Use and critically compare chemical models with theory",
              "description": "Die lernende Person kann für chemische Fragestellungen geeignete analoge und digitale Modelle oder Simulationen zu Atombau und Periodizität, chemischen Gleichgewichten, Bindungsverhältnissen und Molekülgeometrien sowie Wechselwirkungen komplexer Moleküle einschließlich Wirkstoff–Rezeptor- und Substrat–Enzym-Beziehungen auswählen und nutzen, Aussagen oder Hypothesen damit prüfen und ihre Aussagekraft, Grenzen und möglichen Weiterentwicklungen anhand von Beobachtungen oder Vergleichen begründen.",
              "descriptionEn": "For chemical questions, the learner can select and use appropriate analogue and digital models or simulations of atomic structure and periodicity, chemical equilibria, bonding and molecular geometry, and interactions of complex molecules including drug–receptor and substrate–enzyme relationships, test statements or hypotheses and justify their explanatory power, limitations and possible development from observations or comparisons.",
              "requires": [
                "6c7ce93c-7675-51da-bc0c-7d0257f7ff7d",
                "a9c22adc-b543-5b0c-a2d8-3189facdff08"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "proposalOnly": "Old mapped aggregate is now a model/data family with independently assessed atomic children and boundary metadata. Prepare exact atomic replacements with whole source operation and stage/course retained; do not add entire cross-stage cluster merely to obtain nonempty intersection. HB digital-model row includes old data-family edge and must be checked against current model atoms."
    },
