                    "sourceContext": "BW process competencies 2.1(5,7,8,12), 2.2(3,7) physical11-12/printed9-10; LK3.4.3(10-13) actual concentration titration and conductometric measurement physical35/printed33. Generic source duties support own contextual acquisition, not exact full supplied-case coverage.",
                    "existingDependentGoalId": "4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd",
                    "acquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged goal and P including independent data documentation or interpretation, complete current R1/R2 and D2 or temperature/conductivity tasks, raw-value preservation, units, source, conditions, uncertainty/confound limits and fresh transfer.",
                    "compilerScopeSemantics": "Current stock compiler already includes BW by requires closure. This adds no applicability override or mapping; the whole authored view explicitly supplies the target role.",
                    "topicChoiceBoundary": "Required own foundation for an already authored target under the include-authored-topics-before-selector owner policy. No individual research-topic choice or universal official EDTA obligation is inferred.",
